以下代码输出是？
```python
class A:
    def __init__(self):
        self.x = 1
class B(A):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.y = 2
b = B()
print(b.x, b.y)
```

以下代码输出什么？
```python
def my_decorator(func):
    def wrapper():
        print("Before")
        func()
        print("After")
    return wrapper

@my_decorator
def say_hello():
    print("Hello!")

say_hello()
```
